        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "4254078b-7882-39bc-9d9b-4e804c61fe37",
                "word": "OG",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "2359783c-762d-4d6c-9e3e-6baa4c3e5e4e",
                        "entry_id": "4254078b-7882-39bc-9d9b-4e804c61fe37",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more OG"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "f231033f-2032-4d41-9094-a5e8572c21d2",
                        "entry_id": "4254078b-7882-39bc-9d9b-4e804c61fe37",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most OG"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e250d704-a9a4-3b9c-bf1b-c9043e6586c4",
                        "entry_id": "4254078b-7882-39bc-9d9b-4e804c61fe37",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Traditional, authentic, old-fashioned, or old school."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "US",
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "36517b4c-9925-4356-865e-2a6a018d5896",
                                "sense_id": "e250d704-a9a4-3b9c-bf1b-c9043e6586c4",
                                "text": "To slow it down, the below song is a throwback remake using a song from 90's babies' parents' generation. It's definitely a majority favorite, and while I wouldn't say it's better than the OG version, it's definitely soothing to the ear."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dbc53d88-2ba2-4044-a169-ed4bde447a8b",
                                "sense_id": "e250d704-a9a4-3b9c-bf1b-c9043e6586c4",
                                "text": "A lot of people freak out at the idea of lard, but it's actually not that bad for you, and it's what they use in O.G., legit-sh*t tamales—and I'd imagine that's what the abuela in Coco is making"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8a18f53b-6e86-48d6-bbd7-8ec7eb072046",
                                "sense_id": "e250d704-a9a4-3b9c-bf1b-c9043e6586c4",
                                "text": "The Warehouse gym is a little off the beaten track, plopped south of an interstate highway, behind a hidden road. “You have to be kind of a real O.G. baller to know where it is,” Jewell Loyd said."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8043460d-d873-3947-9e49-7b2813216b84",
                        "entry_id": "4254078b-7882-39bc-9d9b-4e804c61fe37",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Relating to a username which is a common word, phrase, or name."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0790cec3-a58c-4cd5-9c25-036d15b4dbc9",
                                "sense_id": "8043460d-d873-3947-9e49-7b2813216b84",
                                "text": "Accounts with OG names like \"Daniel\" or \"summer\" can often fetch a high price."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1bb2610e-405e-43fa-aede-3a9b22880c13",
                                "sense_id": "8043460d-d873-3947-9e49-7b2813216b84",
                                "text": "I joined Twitter pretty early and managed to snag a semi-OG handle."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ee94d385-6e76-40a2-9b7e-bbc1a970d890",
                                "sense_id": "8043460d-d873-3947-9e49-7b2813216b84",
                                "text": "I'm sure in lots of cases people get paid. In fact there is a black market for OG handles that can reach prices of up to 5k."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2fc6f8e3-c7a8-40ba-9000-a85efd27258f",
                                "sense_id": "8043460d-d873-3947-9e49-7b2813216b84",
                                "text": "Tryna fill my friends list with og/semi og names."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b305469a-3aa6-4637-b271-30158b63816c",
                                "sense_id": "8043460d-d873-3947-9e49-7b2813216b84",
                                "text": "Just wait untill the doxing / social engineering comes for og accounts"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6a7568e4-2256-41ab-8108-2cf1c87861b5",
                                "sense_id": "8043460d-d873-3947-9e49-7b2813216b84",
                                "text": "Shut down http://kyo.rip, haven't touched siege in ages, lots of people using the site to try to brute force accounts, check for og names and just being weirdos and I cba to update or maintain the site anymore. Goodbye"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "521414ae-2af2-4d14-854e-7aaedb6ec1d9",
                                "sense_id": "8043460d-d873-3947-9e49-7b2813216b84",
                                "text": "It's a semi OG name, CocoChopper isn't og in any way"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
