                                "sense_id": "3ba3daf7-cacc-3bb1-8a5d-438408457b1d",
                                "text": "Besides the standard tomatoes-over-cheese version, called the O.G., and an even more streamlined cheeseless tomato pie called the Plain Jane, Washington Squares exploits the structural stability of the crust with more elaborate arrays."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "12854e6a-2363-42ac-9617-a6051f5ce024",
                                "sense_id": "3ba3daf7-cacc-3bb1-8a5d-438408457b1d",
                                "text": "And we’d all go to the true O.G., Julius’. It’s the oldest gay bar in New York, plus it has delicious grilled cheese sandwiches and French fries."
